---
name: "Okta System Log: API Polling"
description: >-
  Polls the Okta System Log API and publishes the events on the `okta` topic.
---

// The pipeline starts one hour in the past and then follows the cursor that
// Okta returns. The cursor lives only as long as the pipeline: after a
// restart, the events of the last hour arrive again. The `uuid` of an event
// identifies such duplicates.
okta::fetch "example.okta.com", bearer_token=secret("OKTA_ACCESS_TOKEN")
publish "okta"
